1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 5=

3
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:15,280
Hello.

4
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:16,360
Hello.

5
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,280
How's it going?

6
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:18,640
Sorry I'm late.

7
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:19,920
You're not mad at me, are you?

8
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:20,960
Of course not.

9
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,520
How is it?

10
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:22,280
Having fun?

11
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,320
Yeah.

12
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,760
Go see for yourself.

13
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:31,400
How's it going?

14
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,280
Here's our leading lady.

15
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:34,360
Come on.

16
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:52,400
Isn't this our rising idol,

17
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,720
Li Senyao?

18
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:56,000
I hear he's a great singer.

19
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,400
I hear you're pretty good, too.

20
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,120
Your idol's here.

21
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,000
Why don't you sing a song for him?

22
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,360
Come on, sing something.

23
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:04,720
Sing.

24
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,840
Don't you love singing?

25
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:09,000
Stop singing alone in your dorm.

26
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,040
Let everyone hear you.

27
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,600
Not going to sing?

28
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:17,800
Break her record.

29
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,520
Sure.

30
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,080
Don't!

31
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,520
Last chance.

32
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,600
Are you going to sing?

33
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:24,520
I'll sing.

34
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,820
(PERFECT)

35
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:46,520
Doesn't she sound great?

36
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:53,020
(Published successfully)

37
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:16,760
(Song Yang.)

38
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:19,120
I'm at the MG Company parking lot.

39
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,720
All the dashcam recordings
from this vehicle

40
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,040
have been deleted.

41
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,520
Should I go inside
the company to investigate?

42
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,400
Not for now.

43
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,880
MG Company has tight security.

44
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,280
Until I've completely erased
your records

45
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,520
from Cedar,

46
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,720
don't take any risks.

47
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:31,320
(Ada.)

48
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:32,840
(I'm going to use
a web crawler to filter)

49
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,240
(all information related to MG,)

50
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:36,080
including its artists
and fan communities,

51
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,440
to see if I can find
any clues from outside.

52
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:46,162
(Li Senyao, first Best New Artist nomination,)

53
00:03:46,162 --> 00:03:51,340
(song ranked in the HOT chart's top 10
for three consecutive months)

54
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:11,540
(Congratulations! You've won
backstage access to the concert)

55
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,440
How's your leg?

56
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,600
No need to help me.

57
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,240
Don't be nervous.

58
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,120
You can take photos together,

59
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,800
but no audio or video recording.

60
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,560
Let him go on next.

61
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,960
I'll talk about it later.

62
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,160
You're not in good shape.

63
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,200
What are you trying to do?

64
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,000
Hello, Lulu.

65
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,320
Long time no see.

66
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,400
I heard about what happened last time.

67
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:41,760
I'm sorry

68
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,800
you had to go through that.

69
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,440
No, it wasn't your fault.

70
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,200
I've kept listening to your songs,

71
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,720
and that's what kept me going.

72
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:51,000
Thank you for supporting me, Lulu.

73
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,480
None of us is perfect.

74
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,640
We have to accept our imperfections.

75
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,040
I hope

76
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,640
when you go home this time,

77
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,000
you'll take good care of yourself.

78
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,480
Okay.

79
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,480
Isn't that plush toy

80
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,800
from my first batch of merchandise

81
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,920
before my official debut?

82
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,840
That was my

83
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:14,960
favorite toy when I was little.

84
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,600
I can't believe you've kept it
in such good condition.

85
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,000
Can I...

86
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:23,160
Can we take a photo together?

87
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:23,920
Of course.

88
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,320
I'll take it.

89
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,320
Thank you.

90
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,280
No problem.

91
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,320
Three, two, one.

92
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:42,920
That looks great.

93
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,240
Carry on chatting.

94
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,160
You can do it.

95
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:27,800
Senyao.

96
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,200
Your next performance is about to start.

97
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,320
Sir.

98
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,320
Ms. Xu is asking for you.

99
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,560
We should get going.

100
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,320
Thank you for your hard work.

101
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:42,360
Take care on your way home.

102
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,280
Thank you so much.

103
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:43,920
Bye.

104
00:08:04,180 --> 00:08:09,420
(Li SY)

105
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:10,006
(New song teaser.
New song launch interview.)

106
00:08:10,006 --> 00:08:10,820
(Studio song preview.
Behind the scenes of new song recording)

107
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:11,379
(Concert performance video.
Concert rehearsal version.)

108
00:08:11,379 --> 00:08:12,020
(Post-concert interview.
Behind the scenes of dance rehearsals)

109
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,600
We must all be perfect.

110
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,560
If you're not perfect,

111
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,600
you don't deserve to be on stage.

112
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,800
Hello, what's your motto in life?

113
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,880
My motto is

114
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,680
to do everything

115
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:41,160
perfectly.

116
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,400
Every one of us

117
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:44,640
has imperfections.

118
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,760
We have to accept our imperfections.

119
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:56,780
(Yaostrawberry Healing Planet)

120
00:08:56,780 --> 00:08:57,820
(Yaostrawberry:
I haven't seen it yet. Where is it?)

121
00:08:57,820 --> 00:08:58,350
(Yaostrawberry Healing Planet:
Just got out of class.)

122
00:08:58,350 --> 00:08:58,940
(Yaostrawberry:
Why haven't I seen any new merchandise yet?)

123
00:08:58,940 --> 00:08:59,520
(Yaoberry Little Chef:
I haven't checked yet)

124
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,777
(Yaomengmeng:
Look up Li SY on the official website)

125
00:09:00,777 --> 00:09:01,720
(Can anyone figure out what this says?)

126
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,254
(Yaomengmeng:
I found it on the official website)

127
00:09:03,254 --> 00:09:04,320
(It looks like some strange code.)

128
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,140
(You unsent a message)

129
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:05,620
(You have been removed
from the group chat)

130
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:24,480
(Information filtering complete.)

131
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,600
(Address does not exist.)

132
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,760
(AGENT CONSOLE)
(Failed to access address.)

133
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:49,480
(Address does not exist.)

134
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,640
(Failed to access address.)

135
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,280
Something's wrong.

136
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,440
It's being deleted a little too quickly.

137
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:02,480
Ada.

138
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,440
I've sent you a photo

139
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,640
of a girl.

140
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,480
Go and make contact with her.

141
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:08,960
Her name is

142
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,120
(Target identified: Qiu Lulu)
Qiu Lulu.

143
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,800
(A student at a music conservatory.)

144
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:12,840
(That bullying video
from a few days ago)

145
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,400
(that spread everywhere.)

146
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,560
(She's the girl in it.)

147
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,800
Hello.

148
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,680
Are you Qiu Lulu?

149
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,800
Were you the one who posted a message

150
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:21,640
in the group yesterday?

151
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,760
(You're being way too direct.)

152
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:25,440
(Who's going to answer that?)

153
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,320
You... You're in that group, too?

154
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:29,240
Do you know why that group

155
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,480
suddenly got shut down yesterday?

156
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:31,760
(She actually believed you?)

157
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,360
Wait.

158
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,860
(See? I told you.)

159
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:36,460
(She's definitely going to suspect you.)

160
00:10:37,060 --> 00:10:38,860
You're not

161
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:40,540
an anti-fan, are you?

162
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:47,660
This is the first edition
of his merchandise

163
00:10:47,660 --> 00:10:49,020
from before his debut.

164
00:10:49,100 --> 00:10:51,060
It's a limited collaboration
with a brand.

165
00:10:51,460 --> 00:10:53,060
Only 30 were made worldwide.

166
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:55,500
Only true fans know about it.

167
00:10:55,780 --> 00:10:56,260
(All right.)

168
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:57,180
(Qiu Lulu really is)

169
00:10:57,180 --> 00:10:58,220
(a very trusting girl.)

170
00:10:58,220 --> 00:10:58,700
Could you...

171
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:00,100
Could you help me

172
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:01,300
with something in the group?

173
00:11:03,660 --> 00:11:04,860
Can you tell me exactly

174
00:11:04,860 --> 00:11:06,020
what happened?

175
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:07,860
Maybe I can help you.

176
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:10,100
That would be great.

177
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:16,460
Something seems really strange to me.

178
00:11:16,460 --> 00:11:17,060
Look at this.

179
00:11:31,660 --> 00:11:33,060
Is this what you're talking about?

180
00:11:34,060 --> 00:11:35,260
And it's not just that.

181
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:38,420
That day, he told me backstage

182
00:11:39,180 --> 00:11:40,820
that none of us needs to be perfect.

183
00:11:41,140 --> 00:11:42,060
But you know what?

184
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:43,940
In every interview, he says

185
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:44,780
if you're not perfect,

186
00:11:44,780 --> 00:11:46,300
you don't deserve to be on stage.

187
00:11:47,860 --> 00:11:49,780
Do you see what I'm getting at?

188
00:11:53,220 --> 00:11:53,980
I don't understand.

189
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:57,820
What I mean is,

190
00:11:58,260 --> 00:11:59,460
well,

191
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:01,300
how could he possibly say
something like that?

192
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:02,780
It doesn't make sense.

193
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:06,260
But the person I met backstage that day

194
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:08,820
couldn't have been fake.

195
00:12:10,140 --> 00:12:11,740
And I even

196
00:12:11,740 --> 00:12:13,900
gave him a hug.

197
00:12:14,700 --> 00:12:16,180
Could it be

198
00:12:16,620 --> 00:12:18,860
that the real Li Senyao

199
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:20,500
has been replaced by an android?

200
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:42,740
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

201
00:12:43,750 --> 00:12:48,460
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

202
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:51,530
♪That's me, too♪

203
00:12:53,070 --> 00:12:56,590
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

204
00:12:57,420 --> 00:13:00,680
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

205
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:05,130
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

206
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:08,070
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

207
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:12,630
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

208
00:13:12,630 --> 00:13:14,880
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

209
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:18,050
♪Bring me something more?♪

210
00:13:18,670 --> 00:13:25,480
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

211
00:13:26,260 --> 00:13:29,580
♪Sadness is blue♪

212
00:13:30,690 --> 00:13:33,930
♪How would you paint me?♪

213
00:13:34,930 --> 00:13:38,660
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

214
00:13:38,660 --> 00:13:40,700
♪Painting without restraint♪

215
00:13:41,110 --> 00:13:43,700
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

216
00:13:43,700 --> 00:13:47,650
♪If I could start over♪

217
00:13:48,060 --> 00:13:51,960
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

218
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:54,610
♪Give me back my smile♪

219
00:13:55,170 --> 00:13:57,660
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

220
00:13:58,240 --> 00:14:03,220
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
